3. In vitest.e2e.config.ts change include to ['usr/**/*.e2e.ts', 'apps/studio/e2e/**/*.e2e.ts'] (local edit, only so Vitest picks up the script).
4. mkdir -p usr/pages; save the harness below as usr/run.e2e.ts and the page in `input` as usr/pages/a16-gradient-html.html (its first line names the checks to run, and tokens if any).
